Scheme ID	"SCH002"
Scheme Name	"Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi (PM-KISAN)"
Category	"Agriculture"
Description	"Central Government scheme providing financial support to landholding farmer families for agricultural and domestic needs."
Benefits	"₹6,000 per year per eligible farmer family, paid directly into the bank account in three instalments of ₹2,000 each."
Eligibility	"Landholding farmer families with cultivable land recorded in their names, subject to government exclusion criteria."
Application Process	"Register through the PM-KISAN official portal or a Common Service Centre (CSC). Aadhaar authentication and e-KYC are required. State authorities verify eligibility."
Documents Required	"Aadhaar details, land ownership records, bank account number, IFSC code and mobile number (where available)."
FAQs	"1. Who can apply? Eligible landholding farmer families. 2. How much assistance is provided? ₹6,000 yearly. 3. How is money paid? Direct bank transfer. 4. Is e-KYC required? Yes."
Official Source URL	"https://pmkisan.gov.in/"
official_url	"https://pmkisan.gov.in/"
