Scheme ID	"SCH004"
Scheme Name	"Ayushman Bharat – Pradhan Mantri Jan Arogya Yojana (AB PM-JAY)"
Category	"Health"
Description	"Government health protection scheme providing cashless hospital treatment to eligible families."
Benefits	"Health coverage up to ₹5 lakh per eligible family per year for covered hospital treatments at empanelled hospitals."
Eligibility	"Eligible poor and vulnerable families identified under scheme criteria. All senior citizens aged 70 years or above are also eligible, regardless of income."
Application Process	"Check eligibility on the official beneficiary portal. Complete Aadhaar-based e-KYC and obtain an Ayushman Card through the portal, CSC or an authorised facility."
Documents Required	"Aadhaar card, ration card or other family identification documents as applicable. Aadhaar-based e-KYC is required."
FAQs	"1. What is the coverage? Up to ₹5 lakh per eligible family yearly. 2. Is treatment cashless? Yes, at empanelled hospitals. 3. Are senior citizens aged 70+ eligible? Yes, regardless of income."
