Scheme ID	"SCH006"
Scheme Name	"Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana – Urban 2.0 (PMAY-U 2.0)"
Category	"Housing & Urban Development"
Description	"Government housing scheme that supports eligible urban families in constructing, purchasing or renting affordable houses."
Benefits	"Government assistance of up to ₹2.50 lakh per unit under applicable scheme components. Interest subsidy is also available under the ISS component, subject to conditions."
Eligibility	"Urban families belonging to EWS, LIG or MIG categories with no pucca house anywhere in India in the name of any family member. Income limits: EWS up to ₹3 lakh, LIG ₹3–6 lakh, MIG ₹6–9 lakh annually."
Application Process	"Apply through the PMAY-U 2.0 Unified Web Portal, Common Service Centre or concerned Urban Local Body/Municipality. Application is verified by the relevant authorities."
Documents Required	"Aadhaar details, bank account details, eligibility undertaking, income proof and land ownership documents where applicable."
FAQs	"1. Who can apply? Eligible urban EWS/LIG/MIG families. 2. Must the family own no pucca house? Yes. 3. What is the assistance? Up to ₹2.50 lakh per unit under applicable components. 4. Where to apply? Online portal, CSC or ULB."
Official Source URL	"https://pmay-urban.gov.in/"
official_url	"https://pmay-urban.gov.in/"
