Scheme ID	"SCH007"
Scheme Name	"PM Street Vendor's AtmaNirbhar Nidhi (PM SVANidhi)"
Category	"Employment & Self-Employment"
Description	"Government scheme that provides working capital loans to street vendors to help them run and grow their small businesses."
Benefits	"Collateral-free loans in three stages: up to ₹15,000, ₹25,000 and ₹50,000. Also provides 7% interest subsidy on regular repayment and other digital payment incentives."
Eligibility	"Street vendors identified under the scheme through a Certificate of Vending (CoV), Letter of Recommendation (LoR) or applicable local authority verification. Coverage is being expanded to additional areas in phases."
Application Process	"Apply through the official PM SVANidhi portal or mobile app, or get assistance from the Urban Local Body (ULB)."
