Scheme ID	"SCH008"
Scheme Name	"PM-USP Central Sector Scheme of Scholarship for College and University Students (CSSS)"
Category	"Education & Scholarships"
Description	"Government scholarship that provides financial assistance to meritorious students from families with limited income to support their higher education."
Benefits	"₹12,000 per year for the first three years of undergraduate study and ₹20,000 per year for postgraduate study. Different rates apply to certain professional courses."
Eligibility	"Students scoring above the 80th percentile in Class 12 of their respective board, pursuing regular recognised college/university courses, with family income up to ₹4.5 lakh per year, and not receiving another scholarship or fee reimbursement under the scheme rules."
Application Process	"Apply online through the National Scholarship Portal (NSP). Complete One Time Registration (OTR), submit the application and undergo institute and government verification."
Documents Required	"Class 12 marksheet, family income certificate, bank account details, Aadhaar/OTR details and other documents requested by NSP."
FAQs	"FAQs: Who can apply? Eligible meritorious college students. What is the income limit? ₹4.5 lakh per year. Where to apply? National Scholarship Portal. Is OTR required? Yes."
