Scheme ID	"SCH009"
Scheme Name	"Stand-Up India Scheme"
Category	"Business & Entrepreneurship"
Description	"Government scheme that encourages women and SC/ST entrepreneurs to start new businesses by providing access to bank loans."
Benefits	"Bank loans above ₹10 lakh and up to ₹1 crore, covering up to 85% of the project cost, subject to scheme conditions."
Eligibility	"Women and Scheduled Caste (SC)/Scheduled Tribe (ST) entrepreneurs setting up a new (greenfield) enterprise in manufacturing, services, trading or agriculture-related activities."
