Scheme ID	"SCH010"
Scheme Name	"PM Vishwakarma Scheme"
Category	"Skill Development & Traditional Occupations"
Description	"Government scheme that supports traditional artisans and craftspeople by providing skill training, modern tools, financial assistance and marketing support."
Benefits	"Toolkit incentive up to ₹15,000; training stipend of ₹500 per day; collateral-free loans up to ₹3 lakh in two stages (₹1 lakh and ₹2 lakh); digital transaction incentives and marketing support."
Eligibility	"Indian artisans and craftspeople aged 18 or above working in one of the 18 notified traditional trades in the unorganised sector on a self-employment basis. Only one member per family can register. Government employees and their family members are not eligible. Other loan-related conditions apply."
