Scheme Name	"Pradhan Mantri Shram Yogi Maan-Dhan Yojana (PM-SYM)"
Category	"Labour Welfare & Social Security"
Description	"Government pension scheme that provides old-age financial security to workers in the unorganised sector."
Benefits	"Assured monthly pension of ₹3,000 after attaining 60 years of age. The Central Government contributes an equal amount to the worker's monthly contribution."
